                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Irgun Zvai Leumi</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The Irgun has gradually increased from 7,000 to 12,000 during the past 4 to 6
                    months.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Stem Gang</hi>
                </p>
                <p>A similar rise in Stern Gang numbers from 400–800 has been recently
                    confirmed.</p>
